2:T469,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","@id":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/bugs-in-kitchen-voice#blogposting","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/bugs-in-kitchen-voice","headline":"Bugs in the Kitchen","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/bugs-in-kitchen-voice","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Guy Harris","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/voiceoverguy","image":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/images/guy-harris-profile.jpg"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"VoiceoverGuy","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/images/guy-harris-voiceover.png"}},"inLanguage":"en-GB","isAccessibleForFree":true,"description":"Guy Harris delivers the high-energy voiceover for Bugs in the Kitchen. A fast-paced, fun and frantic kids’ toy advert packed with bug-chasing excitement.","datePublished":"2017-07-01T00:00:00+00:00","dateModified":"2017-07-01T00:00:00+00:00","keywords":["kids toys tv"],"image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/img/blog/bugs-in-kitchen-voice.jpg"}}3:T40e,<h2>My Voice is still on Kids' TV!</h2>
<p>I'm back on the TV for another kids' toy commercial. If you'd like to listen to a backlog of some of my work, check out my <a href="/commercial-voiceover" target="_blank" title="TV Ad Voiceover">commercial voiceover page</a>. It's nice to be asked, again and again, to voice TV adverts for kid's toys. Obviously my voice seems to be a good fit for the toy industry and I think the fact that I enjoy it so much comes through in my performance. Again and again, I'm asked: "We need an energetic voice for this ad please, Guy". If it's not <a href="/doggie-doo-voice-over" target="_blank" title="Doggie Doo">Doggie Doo</a> or <a href="/minecraft-combat-voiceover" target="_blank" title="Minecraft Handbook"> Minecraft Handbook</a>, I'm constantly told I've been heard on other TV adverts on the younger generation TV channels for various toys and games, and then my <a href="/santa-voice" target="_blank" title="Santa Voiceover">Santa voice</a> is heard everywhere on the run-up to Christmas. </p>7:["slug","bugs-in-kitchen-voice","d"]
